From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:01:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] AROS: the package's configuration in PROGDIR:share

Repository: https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch
Base: fastfetch 2.70.0, 17bb3fd2384bd814b421d73b8c8b8d08e06cfa26
Problem: the last configuration directory was PROGDIR:, so fastfetch
looked for PROGDIR:fastfetch/config.jsonc. That drawer cannot exist: the
program itself is the file PROGDIR:fastfetch. A package could not ship a
default configuration.
Solution: the directory is PROGDIR:share, where the presets already are
(share/fastfetch/presets); the package's configuration is
PROGDIR:share/fastfetch/config.jsonc. ENVARC: and ENV: still come first.
Scope: common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c.
Upstream-Status: AROS only; part of the AROS backend.
Verification: guest runs: docs/evidence/2026-10-27-r2/ (--list-config-paths,
the default view read from the package).
Removal: with the AROS backend.
---
 src/common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c b/src/common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c
index 4888174..fb1efa7 100644
--- a/src/common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c
+++ b/src/common/impl/FFPlatform_aros.c
@@ -60,7 +60,7 @@ void ffPlatformInitImpl(FFPlatform* platform) {
 
     // AROS has no home directory. User settings live in ENVARC: (kept) and
     // ENV: (this session's copy, made from ENVARC: at boot); fastfetch's
-    // own files beside the program. ENVARC: comes first: --gen-config
+    // own files in the drawer it came in. ENVARC: comes first: --gen-config
     // writes into the first directory, and a file only in ENV: would be
     // gone after the next boot.
     ffStrbufSetStatic(&platform->homeDir, "ENVARC:");
@@ -68,7 +68,9 @@ void ffPlatformInitImpl(FFPlatform* platform) {
 
     addDir(&platform->configDirs, "ENVARC:");
     addDir(&platform->configDirs, "ENV:");
-    addDir(&platform->configDirs, "PROGDIR:");
+    // The package's own settings, beside its presets: PROGDIR:fastfetch/
+    // cannot exist, the program itself is PROGDIR:fastfetch.
+    addDir(&platform->configDirs, "PROGDIR:share");
 
     nameOfLock(GetProgramDir(), &platform->exePath);
     if (platform->exePath.length) {
